questions.solution:
The magnetic field at a distance $r$ from the straight wire
$\begin{aligned}
& B & =\frac{\mu_0 i}{2 \pi r} \text{ or } B \propto \frac{1}{r} \text{ or } \frac{B_2}{B_1}=\frac{r_1}{r_2} \\
\therefore \quad & \frac{B_2}{B} & =\frac{5}{20}=\frac{1}{4} \text{ or } B_2=\frac{B}{4}
\end{aligned}$

